; MITEMSHUB AI v26.7 — Boom 1000 CRASH/BOOM profile
; Deployed 2026-08-30 (fresh-build rollout of all pending v26.x upgrades)
;
; Boom 1000 characteristics:
;   - Frequent small spikes (median 28.5pts, mode 24pts)
;   - Spikes go DOWN against the grind
;   - Grind direction is UP (slow climb)
;   - Post-spike fade = SELL opportunity
;   - Best entry: after spike retrace 30-70%
;
; Strategy: POST-SPIKE FADE ONLY (v25) — TP=3.2xATR optimized, grind disabled
; Risk: Conservative (0.30% per trade, scales with spike probability)
; Magic: 7788100 — fleet exposure guard compliant
;
; v25.9 Intelligence Layers:
;   1. SpikeDetector — tick speed + candle body analysis
;   2. TickPatternAnalyzer — individual tick precursor scoring
;   3. MultiTimeframeConfirm — M1+M5+M15 agreement required
;   4. TimeOfDayAwareness — learns dangerous hours live
;   5. SymbolCalibration — auto-detects Boom 1000 parameters
;   6. DynamicRiskSizing — reduces lot during high spike prob
;   7. CrashBoomStrategy — post-spike fade + grind entries

